WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.910
Most people know the Hulk as a gigantic green
guy who's incredibly strong, super tough,

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:06.800
and can maybe jump really, really far.

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:08.320
Pretty straightforward, right?

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.280
But it turns out that in the comics, the Hulk
actually has a lot of weird bonus abilities

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:12.780
as well.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:16.420
Here's a look at some superpowers most people
don't know the Hulk has.

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:18.060
Beyond sucker punching, that is.

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:23.380
Hulk sees dead people

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:27.520
Weirdly enough, it turns out the Hulk can
detect the spectral realm, and even interact

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:31.180
with it, allowing him to see ghosts as well
as Dr. Strange's astral form.

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:35.320
Although it's never been made official, it's
been suggested that the Hulk gained the ability

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:39.020
to see ghosts because Bruce Banner fears his
abusive father might haunt him.

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:42.580
Being afraid of ghosts makes sense, since
clearly the Hulk's got nothing to fear in

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:43.480
the physical world.

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:47.160
"Is that all you got?"

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:52.580
Hulk has brain-shield

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:56.999
There's nothing worse for a superhero than
being mind-controlled by an evil telepath

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:57.500
or demon.

00:00:57.680 --> 00:01:02.080
Luckily for the Hulk, he's actually naturally
resistant to psychic attack in the comics.

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:06.400
While this ability doesn't have 100 percent
success rate, it has allowed him to fight

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:10.680
off psychic intrusions from the likes of Xemnu,
Mentallo, and even Professor X.

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:15.180
Why the Hulk is resistant to psychic abilities
is unclear, though it might have to do his

00:01:15.180 --> 00:01:16.900
multiple personality disorder.

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:20.520
Still, if you're going to mess with the Hulk's
brain, your best bet is just flying in his

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:21.020
ear.

00:01:25.220 --> 00:01:26.160
Hulk phone home

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:31.500
Bruce Banner may have been born in Dayton,
Ohio, but the Hulk was created in New Mexico,

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:36.060
something he is constantly reminded of thanks
to a powerful homing instinct that continually

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:38.060
draws him back to the deserts of the southwest.

00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:43.600
It's later revealed by an evil future version
of the Hulk named Maestro that his ghost is

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:47.670
what's been summoning Hulk to the bomb site
so that he can absorb enough gamma radiation

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:49.380
through Hulk's body to be reborn.

00:01:49.780 --> 00:01:50.420
Seems legit!

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:52.540
Hulk absorb and expel energy

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:57.500
The Hulk was born when Bruce Banner absorbed
way too much gamma radiation, so it actually

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:01.860
kind of makes sense that the Hulk is able
to absorb and even control gamma energy to

00:02:01.860 --> 00:02:02.600
a limited degree.

00:02:02.980 --> 00:02:07.480
He's used this handy ability on several occasions,
even deflecting gamma rays like a mirror while

00:02:07.490 --> 00:02:08.670
battling the Avengers.

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:09.940
Don’t mess with the Hulk!

00:02:11.320 --> 00:02:12.060
roar

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:15.980
Hulk very, very healthy

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:20.550
Like Wolverine, the Hulk has a superhuman
healing factor, which allows him to recover

00:02:20.550 --> 00:02:22.460
from injuries and fight off diseases.

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:27.380
But he's also aided by that crazy gamma radiation,
which tends to just flat out kill off any

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:30.820
parasites or germs that are stupid enough
to attempt infecting the Hulk.

00:02:30.980 --> 00:02:35.319
Aside from giving him a clean bill of health,
his super-immunity also helps the Hulk detoxify

00:02:35.319 --> 00:02:39.540
when he's been poisoned, something Bruce probably
appreciates when he decides to tie one on

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:40.220
the night before.

00:02:41.120 --> 00:02:41.960
"Sounds amazing."

00:02:42.460 --> 00:02:43.840
"He's also a huge dork.

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:46.840
Chicks dig that."

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:48.740
Hulk is super adaptable

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:53.260
If you've ever seen the Hulk jump up out of
Earth's atmosphere or walk along the bottom

00:02:53.260 --> 00:02:57.600
of the ocean, you probably noticed that he
has certain advantages over normal people.

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:01.920
It's clear that he doesn't need to breathe
and is impervious to the vacuum of space.

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:02.440
But why?

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:06.740
Well, thanks to some research from SHIELD,
we know that the Hulk's gamma mutation allows

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:10.480
him to further mutate and adapt to any environment
he's exposed to.

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:13.520
Probably explains how he managed to walk away
after this:

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:18.760
Hulk has super breath

00:03:19.030 --> 00:03:21.540
Everyone knows about Superman and his super
breath.

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:24.180
But did you know that the Hulk also has lungs
of steel?

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:28.319
Not only does this make him a hit at birthday
parties, it's also a handy trick to use on

00:03:28.319 --> 00:03:32.790
enemies, or even on random forests, like this
one that the Hulk flattened on a whim in Incredible

00:03:32.790 --> 00:03:34.260
Hulk #273.

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:38.760
Apparently the Hulk isn't much of an environmentalist,
but he is a pretty big blow hard.

00:03:38.770 --> 00:03:40.850
"Hulk like raging fire.

00:03:40.850 --> 00:03:43.240
Thor like smoldering fire."

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:45.700
Hulk can punch through time and space

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:47.700
Just how strong is the Hulk?

00:03:47.970 --> 00:03:51.700
Well, it turns out he's strong enough to punch
through dimensional barriers and even destroy

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:54.440
entire dimensions with a swing of his big
dumb fist.

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:59.220
Not only that, but in one story he was able
to punch his way through a time-storm, and

00:03:59.240 --> 00:04:02.560
on another occasion he plugged a black hole
— with his butt.

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:07.500
You might say the Hulk has godlike powers,
except, well… he's kind of in a class all

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:08.000
his own.

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:18.560
"Puny god."

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:19.860
Thanks for watching!

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:22.180
Click the Looper icon to subscribe to our
YouTube channel.

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:24.440
Plus check out all this cool stuff we know
you'll love, too!

